                            <comment id="17296013" author="mmuzaf" created="Fri, 5 Mar 2021 13:16:22 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ilyak&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ilyak&quot;&gt;ilyak&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I don&apos;t think we can change something here. According to the &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; commit do not have the &quot;URL&quot; command-line property simultaneously with setting &lt;tt&gt;-d Driver&lt;/tt&gt; was an issue which has been fixed in 1.7.0 &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;2&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/julianhyde/sqlline/pull/236/files#diff-cb4a4540820da130c7309afccffe53450738acaf77ab35ab346d1c8b18da0d23R408&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/julianhyde/sqlline/pull/236/files#diff-cb4a4540820da130c7309afccffe53450738acaf77ab35ab346d1c8b18da0d23R408&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;2&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/julianhyde/sqlline/blob/master/HISTORY.md#170-2019-03-27&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/julianhyde/sqlline/blob/master/HISTORY.md#170-2019-03-27&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17296101" author="ilyak" created="Fri, 5 Mar 2021 15:34:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Do we really need to specify -d Driver in case when we already supply the correct classpath? I will check it.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17296144" author="ilyak" created="Fri, 5 Mar 2021 16:15:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I don&apos;t think that we need it at all. I will remove it.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17297601" author="mmuzaf" created="Mon, 8 Mar 2021 18:02:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ilyak&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ilyak&quot;&gt;ilyak&lt;/a&gt; can you, please, check my PR?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17297958" author="ilyak" created="Tue, 9 Mar 2021 09:17:33 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;LGTM &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=mmuzaf&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;mmuzaf&quot;&gt;mmuzaf&lt;/a&gt;. I&apos;ve only checked Linux, I had to admit.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
